45
00:01:45,873 --> 00:01:47,275
Oh, hi, Crow.

46
00:01:47,308 --> 00:01:48,342
-Good morning, sir.

47
00:01:48,375 --> 00:01:51,378
Uh, may I speak to the
man or lady of the house?

48
00:01:51,412 --> 00:01:51,947
-Oh, boy.

49
00:01:51,980 --> 00:01:53,548
-Ah, hello ma'am.

50
00:01:53,582 --> 00:01:54,748
My name is Crow T Robot.

51
00:01:54,782 --> 00:01:57,918
And I'm selling grit to raise
money to keep kids like me

52
00:01:57,952 --> 00:01:58,787
