64
00:02:18,907 --> 00:02:19,840
-Uh, uh, uh.

65
00:02:19,873 --> 00:02:20,575
Oh.

66
00:02:20,608 --> 00:02:21,977
Uh, OK, sir.

67
00:02:22,010 --> 00:02:24,812
Uh, may I interest you
and the little lady

68
