82
00:02:48,435 --> 00:02:49,603
It's for your own good.

83
00:02:49,637 --> 00:02:50,570
-Uh, Joel, uh, let me ask you.

84
00:02:50,603 --> 00:02:52,773
Uh, have you reviewed
your insurance needs

85
00:02:52,807 --> 00:02:53,708
