50 pounds of kitty litter,

96
00:03:12,760 --> 00:03:15,663
uh, I can win a shoestring
and a picture of Eve Arden.

97
00:03:15,697 --> 00:03:16,463
-Yeah.

98
00:03:16,497 --> 00:03:18,032
It says here, if
I sell my soul, I

99
00:03:18,065 --> 00:03:19,933
