113
00:03:47,128 --> 00:03:50,965
I, Dr. Clayton Forrester have
discovered an important truth.

114
00:03:50,998 --> 00:03:54,202
Before adulthood, when
booze becomes a stable,

115
00:03:54,235 --> 00:03:57,805
