Butter Fudge toothpaste.

120
00:04:11,752 --> 00:04:15,690
It also comes in Cookies 'N
Cream, Rocky Road, Banana Fudge

121
00:04:15,723 --> 00:04:17,225
Ripple, and 31 other flavors.

122
00:04:17,258 --> 00:04:18,092
Um.

123
00:04:18,125 --> 00:04:19,993
