224
00:07:18,940 --> 00:07:19,307
-Fine.

225
00:07:19,340 --> 00:07:20,140
-Hm.

226
00:07:20,173 --> 00:07:21,140
Good night, Ken.

227
00:07:21,173 --> 00:07:23,310
