240
00:07:43,063 --> 00:07:43,963
-Hm.

241
00:07:43,997 --> 00:07:46,300
-Aw, it's a shame it
had to be this way.

242
00:07:46,333 --> 00:07:48,268
Well, tonight of all nights.

243
00:07:48,302 --> 00:07:50,137
-I'm sorry too.

244
00:07:50,170 --> 00:07:51,738
-When Anne Sexton
throws a party--

245
00:07:51,772 --> 00:07:54,975
-Well, it's getting late and--
and since Ken isn't coming

246
00:07:55,008 --> 00:07:55,842
