247
00:07:55,875 --> 00:07:56,677
-And since I'm
ruining your marriage!

248
00:07:56,710 --> 00:07:57,943
-I gues I'd better go.

249
00:07:57,977 --> 00:08:00,247
-Well, Cynthia, can I give you
some more coffee, or some cake,

250
00:08:00,280 --> 00:08:01,047
