solves everything!

252
00:08:02,082 --> 00:08:02,450
-No, thanks.

253
00:08:02,483 --> 00:08:04,652
Really.

254
00:08:04,685 --> 00:08:06,320
I'll just, uh, call a cab.

255
00:08:06,353 --> 00:08:07,388
-Well, wait a minute.

256
00:08:07,422 --> 00:08:08,488
Why take a cab?

257
00:08:08,522 --> 00:08:09,757
