fertile and can be developed.

2320
01:14:39,710 --> 01:14:40,610
-Hm, delicious.

2321
01:14:40,643 --> 01:14:41,545
-Mr. Secretary, please.

2322
01:14:41,578 --> 01:14:41,978
-What is, Rocky?

2323
01:14:42,012 --> 01:14:43,580
-And Bavarro.

2324
01:14:43,613 --> 01:14:45,182
-Yes, Rocky?

2325
01:14:45,215 --> 01:14:47,217
-We should make plans
quickly to evacuate--

2326
01:14:47,250 --> 01:14:49,052
-Ew!

2327
01:14:49,085 --> 01:14:51,722
-But we should speed the plans
to evacuate Posita, first.

2328
01:14:51,755 --> 01:14:53,090
-Then draw names for Christmas.

2329
01:14:53,123 --> 01:14:54,323
-If this can be done
in time, Cleolanta

2330
01:14:54,357 --> 01:14:57,027
can have her chance
to save Ophecious,

2331
01:14:57,060 --> 01:14:59,663
by destroying Posita after
Bavarro's people have left it.

2332
01:14:59,697 --> 01:15:01,265
-So it's a win-win situation!

2333
01:15:01,298 --> 01:15:02,332
Hm.

2334
01:15:02,365 --> 01:15:04,233
-Could you get your people
to Nagato, immediately?

2335
01:15:04,267 --> 01:15:06,670
-We can shuttle
airships very fast,

2336
01:15:06,703 --> 01:15:08,672
through the atmospheric chain.

2337
01:15:08,705 --> 01:15:10,240
-Oh, you're here.

2338
01:15:10,273 --> 01:15:13,377
-But my moon is the destroyer,
so everything possible

2339
01:15:13,410 --> 01:15:15,045
will be done.

2340
01:15:15,078 --> 01:15:16,613
-Prepare my spaceship at once.

2341
01:15:16,647 --> 01:15:17,680
-Prepare this.

2342
01:15:17,713 --> 01:15:19,783
-Atlasan and I will wait
until Posita is evacuated,

2343
01:15:19,817 --> 01:15:22,352
and then resume
the bombardments.

2344
01:15:22,385 --> 01:15:23,553
-Oh, no, Cleolanta.

2345
01:15:23,587 --> 01:15:24,753
-You get back up to your room.

2346
01:15:24,787 --> 01:15:27,190
-Rick and I will be on the
spaceship with you and Atlasan.

2347
01:15:27,223 --> 01:15:29,492
I'll give the order to
start the bombardment.

2348
01:15:29,525 --> 01:15:30,427
Oh, Winky.

2349
01:15:30,460 --> 01:15:31,360
-Aah!

2350
01:15:31,393 --> 01:15:32,795
-You and Vena will
control the Orbit Jet

2351
01:15:32,828 --> 01:15:34,497
under Secretary Drake's command.

2352
01:15:34,530 --> 01:15:34,897
-Aye, aye, sir.

2353
01:15:34,930 --> 01:15:36,700
-He and her?

2354
01:15:36,733 --> 01:15:38,568
-Word will be sent to
all available spaceships

2355
01:15:38,602 --> 01:15:41,103
to standby to aid in the
evacuation of Ophecious.

2356
01:15:41,137 --> 01:15:41,505
-Ew!

2357
01:15:41,538 --> 01:15:42,205
-Ick!

2358
01:15:42,238 --> 01:15:45,142
-In case the bombardment fails.

2359
01:15:45,175 --> 01:15:45,775
Professor?

2360
01:15:45,808 --> 01:15:46,577
-Uh, I'm not dead yet.

2361
01:15:46,610 --> 01:15:48,578
-Yes, Rocky.

2362
01:15:48,612 --> 01:15:51,282
-You'll come with me to see
if the bombardment shocks

2363
01:15:51,315 --> 01:15:52,182
Posita from its orbit.

2364
01:15:52,215 --> 01:15:53,150
-Yes.

2365
01:15:53,183 --> 01:15:54,317
-Hey, Rocky.

2366
01:15:54,350 --> 01:15:57,387
-No one hugged me today.

2367
01:15:57,420 --> 01:15:59,890
-Bobby, you're a bad person,
and nobody likes you.

2368
01:15:59,923 --> 01:16:01,625
-Board the Orbit Jet.

2369
01:16:01,658 --> 01:16:05,962
[BABY CRYING]

2370
01:16:05,995 --> 01:16:06,962
-Oh, no!

2371
01:16:06,995 --> 01:16:10,733
-Little prince, what's
bothering you this time?

2372
01:16:10,767 --> 01:16:11,267
-Your head.

2373
01:16:13,970 --> 01:16:15,772
-If you could only talk!

2374
01:16:15,805 --> 01:16:17,873
-If you could only act.

2375
01:16:17,907 --> 01:16:18,407
-Hey!

2376
01:16:18,440 --> 01:16:19,608
Maybe it's over now!

2377
01:16:19,642 --> 01:16:20,543
We can out quick and and--

2378
01:16:20,577 --> 01:16:21,277
-Uh, oh.

2379
01:16:21,310 --> 01:16:22,278
It was a storm.

2380
01:16:26,417 --> 01:16:27,683
-Epilogue 45.

2381
01:16:27,717 --> 01:16:29,720
-How is the little
nipper, Martha?

2382
01:16:29,753 --> 01:16:34,223
-The last plane to
Nagato is leaving.

2383
01:16:34,257 --> 01:16:35,558
-"Sophie's Choice."

2384
01:16:35,592 --> 01:16:36,927
-Oh, Nicolette.

2385
01:16:36,960 --> 01:16:40,397
[BABY CRYING]

2386
01:16:40,430 --> 01:16:41,263
-Oh, brother!

2387
01:16:45,402 --> 01:16:46,970
-But there was no
room in the inn.

2388
01:16:47,003 --> 01:16:50,273
Then the space Joseph and
Mary took the tiny infant

2389
01:16:50,307 --> 01:16:51,575
to space Bethlehem.

2390
01:16:51,608 --> 01:16:52,842
And that was when they--

2391
01:16:52,875 --> 01:16:57,380
-Such a fine, little prince to
be raised without a land rule.

2392
01:16:57,413 --> 01:17:00,450
Come, Potonda, I must
prepare the flare signal.

2393
01:17:00,483 --> 01:17:05,422
It will tell Rocky the
evacuation is complete.

2394
01:17:05,455 --> 01:17:07,657
[BABY CRYING]

2395
01:17:07,690 --> 01:17:09,458
-Oh, I've had this
happen before.

2396
01:17:09,492 --> 01:17:09,860
[CHUCKLING]

2397
01:17:09,893 --> 01:17:11,862
-Yep.

2398
01:17:11,895 --> 01:17:15,432
Slug bug, anybody?

2399
01:17:15,465 --> 01:17:17,333
-Hmm, mm, mm.

2400
01:17:17,367 --> 01:17:18,668
[WHISTLING]

2401
01:17:18,702 --> 01:17:20,570
-Ooh, aah!

2402
01:17:20,603 --> 01:17:23,073
An effect!

2403
01:17:23,107 --> 01:17:28,778
-Professor, Vena has just
signalled complete evacuation.

2404
01:17:28,812 --> 01:17:31,548
-Uh, no, that's just
a serial number.

2405
01:17:31,582 --> 01:17:32,882
-Watch carefully, Professor.

2406
01:17:32,915 --> 01:17:34,550
Check to see if we
succeed in shocking

2407
01:17:34,583 --> 01:17:35,785
the moon from its orbit.

2408
01:17:35,818 --> 01:17:39,388
-Uh, I'm still trying
to microwave my burrito.

2409
01:17:39,422 --> 01:17:41,425
-Start the bombardment.

2410
01:17:41,458 --> 01:17:42,425
-What bombardment?

2411
01:17:45,128 --> 01:17:45,695
[GASP]

2412
01:17:45,728 --> 01:17:46,897
-Ooh!

2413
01:17:46,930 --> 01:17:49,498
Aah!

2414
01:17:49,532 --> 01:17:50,900
Aah!

2415
01:17:50,933 --> 01:17:53,437
-Two missles, direct
on target, Professor.

2416
01:17:53,470 --> 01:17:55,038
Report results, please.

2417
01:17:55,072 --> 01:17:57,107
-It went boom.

2418
01:17:57,140 --> 01:17:59,943
-The course of Posita is still
absolute, without deviation,

2419
01:17:59,977 --> 01:18:00,443
Rocky.

2420
01:18:00,477 --> 01:18:01,412
-What do you know.

2421
01:18:01,445 --> 01:18:02,578
-Fire again.

2422
01:18:02,612 --> 01:18:03,547
Again and again.

2423
01:18:03,580 --> 01:18:04,113
-Whoa, whoa!

2424
01:18:04,147 --> 01:18:06,617
Slow down little lady.

2425
01:18:06,650 --> 01:18:08,017
-It's something to do.

2426
01:18:08,050 --> 01:18:08,852
Don't cost nothing.

2427
01:18:08,885 --> 01:18:09,787
-OK.

2428
01:18:09,820 --> 01:18:10,187
-Ooh!

2429
01:18:10,220 --> 01:18:12,155
Ooh, Ooh!

2430
01:18:12,188 --> 01:18:14,157
-You can't blow up a Cocoa Puff.

2431
01:18:14,190 --> 01:18:15,725
To this-- there's just no way.

2432
01:18:19,062 --> 01:18:20,730
-We're dry of
missiles, Professor.

2433
01:18:20,763 --> 01:18:21,565
What's your reading?

2434
01:18:21,598 --> 01:18:24,835
-"The Beauty Myth."

2435
01:18:24,868 --> 01:18:26,903
-Posita does not show
the slightest deviation

2436
01:18:26,937 --> 01:18:27,970
from course, Rocky.

2437
01:18:28,003 --> 01:18:29,472
-But I do.

2438
01:18:29,505 --> 01:18:30,605
-It must not be!

2439
01:18:30,638 --> 01:18:32,842
-The crash of moons is
something that was meant to be,

2440
01:18:32,875 --> 01:18:33,275
Cleolanta.

2441
01:18:33,308 --> 01:18:34,110
We can't stop.

2442
01:18:34,143 --> 01:18:34,745
-It's karma.

2443
01:18:37,213 --> 01:18:39,215
-Ophecian spaceship
to Orbit Jet.

2444
01:18:39,248 --> 01:18:40,250
Rocky Jones to Winky.

2445
01:18:40,283 --> 01:18:41,217
Come in.

2446
01:18:41,250 --> 01:18:42,050
-I'm in a meeting.

2447
01:18:42,083 --> 01:18:44,720
-Ophecian spaceship
to Orbit Jet.

2448
01:18:44,753 --> 01:18:45,687
-Ask nicely.

2449
01:18:45,720 --> 01:18:48,625
-Mr. Secretary, Rocky
Jones is calling in.

2450
01:18:48,658 --> 01:18:50,227
I'm with you, Roc,
what's your report?

2451
01:18:50,260 --> 01:18:52,095
-Uh, don't go in
there for a while.

2452
01:18:52,128 --> 01:18:55,232
-The evacuated moon, Posita
failed to show results.

2453
01:18:55,265 --> 01:18:58,602
Collision with Ophecious
on the 19th is absolute.

2454
01:18:58,635 --> 01:19:00,537
-Well, it figured, Rocky.

2455
01:19:00,570 --> 01:19:01,237
Mr. Secretary.

2456
01:19:01,270 --> 01:19:02,337
-Give me that pinkle Winky.

2457
01:19:02,370 --> 01:19:04,007
-I've alerted all of the
spaceships in the vicinity.

2458
01:19:04,040 --> 01:19:04,840
-Winkle Wink.

2459
01:19:04,873 --> 01:19:06,610
-The fleet will now
go to Ophecious.

2460
01:19:06,643 --> 01:19:07,777
-Look, he's got antelope horns.

2461
01:19:07,810 --> 01:19:08,910
Ha, ha.

2462
01:19:08,943 --> 01:19:11,982
-Cleolanta will be glad to
hear that, Mr. Secretary.

2463
01:19:12,015 --> 01:19:15,152
-A land, a world, where
shall I think my people?

2464
01:19:15,185 --> 01:19:17,087
-Please, Cleolanta, give
us your cooperation.

2465
01:19:17,120 --> 01:19:19,957
We'll do everything possible.

2466
01:19:19,990 --> 01:19:20,890
Now Rocky--

2467
01:19:20,923 --> 01:19:21,890
-It's a plot of United Worlds.

2468
01:19:21,923 --> 01:19:24,895
It's a trick to make the
Ophecious a lost race.

2469
01:19:24,928 --> 01:19:25,462
-Atlasan.

2470
01:19:25,495 --> 01:19:26,028
There's no time to lose.

2471
01:19:26,062 --> 01:19:27,930
There are plans to made.

2472
01:19:27,963 --> 01:19:28,698
it's a plot!

2473
01:19:28,732 --> 01:19:29,332
A trick!

2474
01:19:29,365 --> 01:19:30,300
-A female trick.

2475
01:19:30,333 --> 01:19:32,335
-Yes, Mr. Secretary?

2476
01:19:32,368 --> 01:19:34,838
-Rocky, you will arrive
on Ophecious first.

2477
01:19:34,872 --> 01:19:35,638
-OK.

2478
01:19:35,672 --> 01:19:36,338
-The people must
be warned and told

2479
01:19:36,372 --> 01:19:38,742
to prepare for the evacuation.

2480
01:19:38,775 --> 01:19:41,277
If there is a panic,
everything is lost.

2481
01:19:41,310 --> 01:19:42,110
-Yes, Mr. Secretary.

2482
01:19:42,143 --> 01:19:44,013
-Yeah, disavow
this, Mr. Secretary.

2483
01:19:44,047 --> 01:19:47,850
-And I have a good
partner for the job.

2484
01:19:47,883 --> 01:19:48,583
-Ha, aha.

2485
01:19:48,617 --> 01:19:49,385
-All right, this
must be the end.

2486
01:19:49,418 --> 01:19:50,053
-Ah, right!
-Yay!

2487
01:19:50,087 --> 01:19:50,620
It's over!

2488
01:19:50,653 --> 01:19:51,120
-I kind of liked that.

2489
01:19:51,153 --> 01:19:52,155
It was really fun.

2490
01:19:52,188 --> 01:19:53,623
-Yay!

2491
01:19:53,657 --> 01:19:54,357
-Uh-oh.

2492
01:19:54,390 --> 01:19:55,792
-I guess they're
travelling, huh?

2493
01:19:55,825 --> 01:19:56,325
-Oh, gee!

2494
01:19:56,358 --> 01:19:58,762
For crying out loud.

2495
01:19:58,795 --> 01:19:59,395
-Ach!

2496
01:19:59,428 --> 01:20:00,430
-OK, say cheese, everyone.

2497
01:20:00,463 --> 01:20:02,065
-If you wish, Rocky,
I'll blast down the ship.

2498
01:20:02,098 --> 01:20:02,865
I know the fields.

2499
01:20:02,898 --> 01:20:03,865
-Go ahead, Atlasan.

2500
01:20:03,898 --> 01:20:05,102
-(IMITATING STEWIE) Oh,
suddenly, we're friends?

2501
01:20:10,240 --> 01:20:11,373
[SIGH]

2502
01:20:11,407 --> 01:20:14,777
-Oh, uh, OK now, Mrs. Webb,
uh, we're-- we're gonna--

2503
01:20:14,810 --> 01:20:16,680
we're gonna turn
around here, OK?

2504
01:20:16,713 --> 01:20:17,913
No, no, no, Mrs. Webb!

2505
01:20:17,947 --> 01:20:21,317
Uh, oh!

2506
01:20:21,350 --> 01:20:24,853
-Devo, new traditionalists.

2507
01:20:24,887 --> 01:20:25,753
-Colonel Puppy Paws.

2508
01:20:27,790 --> 01:20:29,125
-(IMITATING DUDLEY
DOORIGHT) Nell, come in!

2509
01:20:31,962 --> 01:20:35,265
-Fort Apache, the
Bronx, by Marx.

2510
01:20:35,298 --> 01:20:36,432
-Hey, you know,
you just can't get

2511
01:20:36,465 --> 01:20:39,068
enough of these
here shots, can ya?

2512
01:20:39,102 --> 01:20:41,672
-Let's milk this dry, huh?

2513
01:20:47,343 --> 01:20:48,245
-A spaceship.

2514
01:20:48,278 --> 01:20:49,312
-Oh, no duh!

2515
01:20:49,345 --> 01:20:50,380
-This is our chance to escape.

2516
01:20:50,413 --> 01:20:52,848
-Whoop!

2517
01:20:52,882 --> 01:20:54,750
-You've given the
orders, Rocky Jones.

2518
01:20:54,783 --> 01:20:55,617
-Mm, hm.

2519
01:20:55,650 --> 01:20:57,153
-But now as Susareign
of Ophecious,

2520
01:20:57,187 --> 01:21:01,257
I demand the right to
speak to my people, alone!

2521
01:21:01,290 --> 01:21:02,523
-Ooh!

2522
01:21:02,557 --> 01:21:05,828
-What he lacks in expression,
he makes up for with hat tips.

2523
01:21:05,862 --> 01:21:08,598
-I must respect your leadership.

2524
01:21:08,632 --> 01:21:09,532
-Atlasan.

2525
01:21:09,565 --> 01:21:10,967
-Look, my name's Gary, OK?

2526
01:21:14,437 --> 01:21:16,472
-She really sucked the
air out of the room.

2527
01:21:16,505 --> 01:21:17,107
-Every time.

2528
01:21:25,482 --> 01:21:27,917
-Your USC Trojans!

2529
01:21:27,950 --> 01:21:29,118
-Ba-ba-ba- bah-ba bop.

2530
01:21:32,422 --> 01:21:33,088
-Ping.

2531
01:21:33,122 --> 01:21:36,325
-All right, now is our chance.

2532
01:21:36,358 --> 01:21:36,927
-Hm, hm, hm.

2533
01:21:36,960 --> 01:21:38,895
Hm, hm.

2534
01:21:38,928 --> 01:21:39,528
Hmm.

2535
01:21:39,562 --> 01:21:41,330
-Hey, it's me, your queen!

2536
01:21:41,363 --> 01:21:43,433
-General wrestle with
the queen, only $2.

2537
01:21:47,403 --> 01:21:53,008
-Yeah, this has all the earmarks
of a run on the bank, to me.

2538
01:21:53,042 --> 01:21:54,143
-Uh, I've got $2.

2539
01:21:54,177 --> 01:21:55,912
I'll wrestle the queen.

2540
01:21:55,945 --> 01:21:56,578
Definitely.

2541
01:21:56,612 --> 01:21:57,947
Mm, hm.

2542
01:21:57,980 --> 01:21:58,613
-Blast off!

2543
01:21:58,647 --> 01:22:00,150
Take us away from Ophecious.

2544
01:22:00,183 --> 01:22:00,817
-Oh yeah?

2545
01:22:00,850 --> 01:22:03,920
Well take this, Puppy Paws.

2546
01:22:03,953 --> 01:22:07,690
-Suddenly, it Guns
N Roses concert.

2547
01:22:07,723 --> 01:22:08,958
-Wrestle the queen?

2548
01:22:08,992 --> 01:22:09,458
Why I oughta--

2549
01:22:14,163 --> 01:22:14,897
-Harold, come on.

2550
01:22:14,930 --> 01:22:15,697
Don't cause trouble.

2551
01:22:15,730 --> 01:22:17,467
Why don't we just
take our seats.

2552
01:22:17,500 --> 01:22:19,602
-Jeez, these flight
attendants are tough!

2553
01:22:19,635 --> 01:22:23,138
-Wouldn't it be more productive
if they did this to Winky?

2554
01:22:23,172 --> 01:22:24,073
-Stop!

2555
01:22:24,107 --> 01:22:25,008
I command it!

2556
01:22:25,042 --> 01:22:25,942
Stop!

2557
01:22:25,975 --> 01:22:27,243
-Ooh!

2558
01:22:27,277 --> 01:22:30,080
Now is my chance to
be a real radio DJ.

2559
01:22:30,113 --> 01:22:32,548
-Please, this is
Trinka, your friend.

2560
01:22:32,582 --> 01:22:33,450
-Trinket?

2561
01:22:33,483 --> 01:22:36,953
-I won't command,
but listen to me.

2562
01:22:36,987 --> 01:22:38,588
You all know what
is going to happen.

2563
01:22:38,622 --> 01:22:40,090
You have a right to be afraid.

2564
01:22:40,123 --> 01:22:42,492
But we have fine friends
who will help us.

2565
01:22:42,525 --> 01:22:43,425
-Hm.

2566
01:22:43,458 --> 01:22:45,662
-If you all behave
in an orderly manner,

2567
01:22:45,695 --> 01:22:48,097
United Worlds will
see that everyone

2568
01:22:48,130 --> 01:22:50,300
is evacuated by the 19th.

2569
01:22:50,333 --> 01:22:50,700
-Yeah.

2570
01:22:50,733 --> 01:22:51,633
Boys!

2571
01:22:51,667 --> 01:22:52,702
-That little lady
makes a lot of sense.

2572
01:22:52,735 --> 01:22:53,302
-That's right.

2573
01:22:53,335 --> 01:22:53,802
-Wow!

2574
01:22:53,835 --> 01:22:55,105
-So go back there.

2575
01:22:55,138 --> 01:22:56,538
-Sorry I hit you, Bob.

2576
01:22:56,572 --> 01:22:58,542
-That would hurt
from down there.

2577
01:22:58,575 --> 01:23:01,443
-Lunch today will be
tomato soup, tater tots,

