house is not a home

2835
01:31:36,592 --> 01:31:40,128
without two people who really
care for one another in it.

2836
01:31:40,162 --> 01:31:42,265
And how could Frank
not care about you,

2837
01:31:42,298 --> 01:31:44,667
Dr. Forrester, with
your sharp, deductive

2838
01:31:44,700 --> 01:31:46,735
mind and your illustrious
sense of humor.

2839
01:31:46,768 --> 01:31:50,673
How lucky for you two to
have found one another.

2840
01:31:50,707 --> 01:31:52,708
And I hope one day
my infant son will

2841
01:31:52,742 --> 01:31:56,345
be able to conduct such
experiments to help, or hurt,

2842
01:31:56,378 --> 01:31:57,580
all of mankind.

2843
01:31:57,613 --> 01:31:59,115
Yes, I say, humankind.

2844
01:31:59,148 --> 01:32:02,518
For none of us would be
here without our mothers.

2845
01:32:02,552 --> 01:32:04,787
Soft and kind and
nurturing mothers.

2846
01:32:04,820 --> 01:32:08,223
And the mothers of the world
are so very, very special.

2847
01:32:08,257 --> 01:32:11,393
I only hope that my son
is born to a mother--

2848
01:32:11,427 --> 01:32:14,763
a mother as wonderful as
yours, Dr. Clayton Forrester.

2849
01:32:14,797 --> 01:32:16,598
Frank!

2850
01:32:16,632 --> 01:32:18,267
Bobby!
